{
  "font_size": 0.4,
  "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
  "background_alpha": 0.5,
  "background_color": "#9C27B0",
  "Stroke": "none",
  "type": "AIsubtitle",
  "lang": "zh",
  "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite",
  "body": [
    {
      "content": "投资的第一条规则就是不要亏损",
      "from": 0.04,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 1,
      "to": 2.1
    },
    {
      "content": "投资的第二条规则就是不要忘记第一条规则",
      "from": 2.1,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 2,
      "to": 4.48
    },
    {
      "content": "这就是所有规则的全部内容",
      "from": 4.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 3,
      "to": 5.58
    },
    {
      "content": "我的意思是如果你以远低于",
      "from": 5.58,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 4,
      "to": 8.18
    },
    {
      "content": "其实际价值的价格买入",
      "from": 8.18,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 5,
      "to": 8.82
    },
    {
      "content": "并购买一组这样的资产",
      "from": 8.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 6,
      "to": 10.1
    },
    {
      "content": "基本上就不会亏钱",
      "from": 10.1,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 7,
      "to": 11.64
    },
    {
      "content": "劳伦",
      "from": 11.64,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 8,
      "to": 12.16
    },
    {
      "content": "你认为投资经理最重要的品质是什么",
      "from": 12.16,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 9,
      "to": 17.439
    },
    {
      "content": "这是一种性格特质",
      "from": 17.559,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 10,
      "to": 18.899
    },
    {
      "content": "而不是智力特质",
      "from": 18.899,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 11,
      "to": 19.859
    },
    {
      "content": "这个行业不需要很高的智商",
      "from": 19.859,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 12,
      "to": 21.899
    },
    {
      "content": "我的意思是你需要足够的智商从这里到奥马哈市中心",
      "from": 21.899,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 13,
      "to": 24.559
    },
    {
      "content": "但你不需要会下三维国际象棋",
      "from": 24.559,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 14,
      "to": 28.79
    },
    {
      "content": "或类似的事情",
      "from": 31.41,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 15,
      "to": 32.39
    },
    {
      "content": "你需要稳定的性格",
      "from": 32.39,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 16,
      "to": 36.309
    },
    {
      "content": "你需要良好的 temperament",
      "from": 36.309,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 17,
      "to": 37.819
    },
    {
      "content": "既不因随大流获得快感",
      "from": 37.819,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 18,
      "to": 42.539
    },
    {
      "content": "也不因逆大流感到愉悦",
      "from": 42.539,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 19,
      "to": 44.779
    },
    {
      "content": "因为这不是需要投票的生意",
      "from": 44.779,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 20,
      "to": 46.49
    },
    {
      "content": "这是一项需要思考的生意",
      "from": 46.49,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 21,
      "to": 49.77
    },
    {
      "content": "本·格雷厄姆会说你不是对或错",
      "from": 49.77,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 22,
      "to": 51.8
    },
    {
      "content": "因为一千个人赞同你",
      "from": 51.8,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 23,
      "to": 53.0
    },
    {
      "content": "你不是对或错",
      "from": 53.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 24,
      "to": 54.52
    },
    {
      "content": "因为一千个人反对你",
      "from": 54.52,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 25,
      "to": 54.96
    },
    {
      "content": "你才是对的",
      "from": 54.96,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 26,
      "to": 56.76
    },
    {
      "content": "因为你的事实和逻辑正确",
      "from": 56.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 27,
      "to": 57.26
    },
    {
      "content": "沃伦",
      "from": 57.26,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 28,
      "to": 58.1
    },
    {
      "content": "你有什么不同",
      "from": 58.1,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 29,
      "to": 59.17
    },
    {
      "content": "市场上90%的基金经理",
      "from": 59.17,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 30,
      "to": 62.629
    },
    {
      "content": "当然",
      "from": 62.629,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 31,
      "to": 63.149
    },
    {
      "content": "大多数专业投资者关注股票未来一两年的表现",
      "from": 63.149,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 32,
      "to": 67.109
    },
    {
      "content": "他们拥有各种",
      "from": 67.109,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 33,
      "to": 68.349
    },
    {
      "content": "各种复杂的",
      "from": 68.349,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 34,
      "to": 71.59
    },
    {
      "content": "分析方法",
      "from": 74.15,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 35,
      "to": 76.21
    },
    {
      "content": "但他们并不真正把自己视为企业所有者",
      "from": 76.21,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 36,
      "to": 80.19
    },
    {
      "content": "判断是否从价值角度投资的真正考验是",
      "from": 80.19,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 37,
      "to": 84.31
    },
    {
      "content": "你是否在意",
      "from": 84.31,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 38,
      "to": 85.83
    },
    {
      "content": "明天股市是否开放",
      "from": 85.83,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 39,
      "to": 87.53
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你在证券上做了优质投资",
      "from": 87.53,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 40,
      "to": 90.39
    },
    {
      "content": "即使股市关闭五年也不会受影响",
      "from": 90.39,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 41,
      "to": 93.23
    },
    {
      "content": "行情板告诉我的只有价格",
      "from": 93.23,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 42,
      "to": 95.22
    },
    {
      "content": "我可以查看价格",
      "from": 95.22,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 43,
      "to": 96.54
    },
    {
      "content": "偶尔看看价格是否异常低廉或过高",
      "from": 96.54,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 44,
      "to": 100.62
    },
    {
      "content": "但价格无法告诉我企业的情况",
      "from": 100.62,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 45,
      "to": 104.37
    },
    {
      "content": "企业",
      "from": 104.37,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 46,
      "to": 105.83
    },
    {
      "content": "企业的数据能反映企业状况",
      "from": 106.89,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 47,
      "to": 109.43
    },
    {
      "content": "但股价无法反映企业情况",
      "from": 109.43,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 48,
      "to": 111.71
    },
    {
      "content": "我宁愿先评估企业价值",
      "from": 111.71,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 49,
      "to": 116.11
    },
    {
      "content": "甚至不知道价格",
      "from": 116.11,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 50,
      "to": 117.74
    },
    {
      "content": "所以我不会被价格影响我的估值判断",
      "from": 117.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 51,
      "to": 121.2
    },
    {
      "content": "然后回头看看价格是否严重偏离",
      "from": 121.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 52,
      "to": 123.74
    },
    {
      "content": "我的价值判断",
      "from": 123.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 53,
      "to": 125.44
    },
    {
      "content": "巴菲特选择留在这个世界",
      "from": 125.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 54,
      "to": 127.62
    },
    {
      "content": "奥马哈内布拉斯加",
      "from": 127.62,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 55,
      "to": 129.3
    },
    {
      "content": "玉米田就在市中心几分钟路程",
      "from": 129.3,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 56,
      "to": 132.31
    },
    {
      "content": "如今奥马哈是个不错的小镇",
      "from": 132.31,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 57,
      "to": 133.95
    },
    {
      "content": "但没人说它是世界金融中心",
      "from": 133.95,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 58,
      "to": 136.25
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你是唯一一群咆哮的野牛其实四足行走",
      "from": 136.25,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 59,
      "to": 140.2
    },
    {
      "content": "你不觉得奥马哈在投资界有点偏僻吗",
      "from": 140.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 60,
      "to": 144.94
    },
    {
      "content": "嗯",
      "from": 144.94,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 61,
      "to": 145.4
    },
    {
      "content": "相信或不信",
      "from": 145.4,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 62,
      "to": 146.519
    },
    {
      "content": "这里收到很多邮件",
      "from": 146.519,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 63,
      "to": 147.499
    },
    {
      "content": "呃",
      "from": 147.499,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 64,
      "to": 148.179
    },
    {
      "content": "我们收到各种期刊",
      "from": 148.179,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 65,
      "to": 149.159
    },
    {
      "content": "并获取所有决策所需的信息",
      "from": 149.159,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 66,
      "to": 150.919
    },
    {
      "content": "与华尔街不同",
      "from": 150.919,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 67,
      "to": 152.59
    },
    {
      "content": "你会发现",
      "from": 152.59,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 68,
      "to": 152.95
    },
    {
      "content": "我们没有五十人围过来耳语",
      "from": 152.95,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 69,
      "to": 155.35
    },
    {
      "content": "说我们应该今天做这做那",
      "from": 155.35,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 70,
      "to": 157.509
    },
    {
      "content": "你是否欣赏这种缺乏刺激",
      "from": 157.509,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 71,
      "to": 159.609
    },
    {
      "content": "就像这里",
      "from": 159.609,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 72,
      "to": 160.029
    },
    {
      "content": "我喜欢这种缺乏刺激",
      "from": 160.029,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 73,
      "to": 161.249
    },
    {
      "content": "我们有事实",
      "from": 161.249,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 74,
      "to": 161.809
    },
    {
      "content": "这里没有干扰",
      "from": 161.809,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 75,
      "to": 163.21
    },
    {
      "content": "你怎么能远离华尔街",
      "from": 163.73,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 76,
      "to": 165.83
    },
    {
      "content": "嗯",
      "from": 165.83,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 77,
      "to": 166.33
    },
    {
      "content": "如果我在华尔街",
      "from": 166.33,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 78,
      "to": 167.29
    },
    {
      "content": "可能早就被过度刺激了",
      "from": 167.29,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 79,
      "to": 172.82
    },
    {
      "content": "你会听到很多消息",
      "from": 172.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 80,
      "to": 177.969
    },
    {
      "content": "你可能会",
      "from": 177.969,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 81,
      "to": 179.049
    },
    {
      "content": "缩短专注力",
      "from": 179.049,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 82,
      "to": 182.889
    },
    {
      "content": "短期专注不利于长期收益",
      "from": 182.889,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 83,
      "to": 186.38
    },
    {
      "content": "而我只需专注企业价值",
      "from": 186.38,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 84,
      "to": 189.599
    },
    {
      "content": "无需在华盛顿",
      "from": 189.599,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 85,
      "to": 193.54
    },
    {
      "content": "判断华盛顿邮报价值",
      "from": 193.54,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 86,
      "to": 194.74
    },
    {
      "content": "无需在纽约",
      "from": 194.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 87,
      "to": 196.86
    },
    {
      "content": "评估其他公司价值",
      "from": 196.86,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 88,
      "to": 198.26
    },
    {
      "content": "这纯粹是",
      "from": 198.26,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 89,
      "to": 199.76
    },
    {
      "content": "这种思维过程越少干扰",
      "from": 199.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 90,
      "to": 203.34
    },
    {
      "content": "对你越好",
      "from": 203.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 91,
      "to": 204.58
    },
    {
      "content": "什么是思维过程",
      "from": 204.58,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 92,
      "to": 205.88
    },
    {
      "content": "思维过程是",
      "from": 205.88,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 93,
      "to": 207.74
    },
    {
      "content": "定义你的水平",
      "from": 209.31,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 94,
      "to": 210.77
    },
    {
      "content": "界定专业领域并评估企业价值",
      "from": 210.77,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 95,
      "to": 213.35
    },
    {
      "content": "在专业领域内",
      "from": 214.51,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 96,
      "to": 217.75
    },
    {
      "content": "寻找以最",
      "from": 217.75,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 97,
      "to": 219.79
    },
    {
      "content": "最接近价值的低价出售",
      "from": 219.79,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 98,
      "to": 222.0
    },
    {
      "content": "还有很多我不擅长评估的事物",
      "from": 222.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 99,
      "to": 224.36
    },
    {
      "content": "但有几个是我能真正欣赏的",
      "from": 224.36,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 100,
      "to": 226.34
    },
    {
      "content": "你有没有买过科技公司",
      "from": 226.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 101,
      "to": 228.22
    },
    {
      "content": "没有",
      "from": 228.22,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 102,
      "to": 228.64
    },
    {
      "content": "在三十年的投资生涯中我真的没买过",
      "from": 228.64,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 103,
      "to": 231.36
    },
    {
      "content": "一个都没买过",
      "from": 231.36,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 104,
      "to": 231.82
    },
    {
      "content": "我对这些都不太了解",
      "from": 231.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 105,
      "to": 233.48
    },
    {
      "content": "所以你从未持有过",
      "from": 233.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 106,
      "to": 234.76
    },
    {
      "content": "例如",
      "from": 234.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 107,
      "to": 235.34
    },
    {
      "content": "国际商用机器公司",
      "from": 235.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 108,
      "to": 235.92
    },
    {
      "content": "我们从未持有过IBM公司",
      "from": 235.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 109,
      "to": 237.74
    },
    {
      "content": "我是说那种令人瞩目的公司",
      "from": 237.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 110,
      "to": 239.12
